  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Department of Energy, Seismic Cooperation Program in the Caucasus and Central Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The award funds U.S. National Laboratory and U.S. university expert engagement building seismic monitoring capacity with institutes in Central Asia and elsewhere. Outreach includes training, joint data analysis, seismometer deployment and performance improvement, and collaborative research and data analysis.</narrative>
  </description>
